<title>JAPAN: Hokkaido Gas - 96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Hokkaido Gas - 96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 55.35		vs	   51.58</p>
<p> Operating	    2.61		vs	    2.57</p>
<p> Current	    917    million    vs	  970    million</p>
<p> Net		  471    million    vs	  493    million</p>
<p> EPS		    7.64 yen	  vs	    8.19 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	  6.94 yen	  vs	    7.38 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hokkaido Gas Co Ltd supplies gas to Sapporo, Otaru and Hakodate in Hokkaido.</p>
